How many rows does the table contain at the end?

```sql
CREATE TABLE loan (tool_id INTEGER NOT NULL, returned_on TEXT);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX one_open ON loan (tool_id) WHERE returned_on IS NULL;
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO loan VALUES (1, '2026-05-01');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO loan VALUES (1, '2026-05-09');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO loan VALUES (1, NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO loan VALUES (1, NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO loan VALUES (2, NULL);
SELECT count(*) FROM loan;
```

What does this program print?

```sql
CREATE TABLE crop (farm TEXT, plant TEXT);
INSERT INTO crop VALUES ('Hill', 'maize'), ('Hill', 'beans'), ('River', 'rice');
SELECT json_object('farm', farm, 'crops', json_group_array(plant))
FROM crop WHERE farm = 'Hill' GROUP BY farm;
```
